PART 6 -- CONTROLS
==============================================================================================================================
  injected 5.000e-11 -> recovered 4.994e-11   (-0.001 dex)
  injected 9.360e-11 -> recovered 9.414e-11   (+0.003 dex)
  injected 1.130e-10 -> recovered 1.126e-10   (-0.002 dex)
  injected 3.744e-10 -> recovered 3.749e-10   (+0.001 dex)
  [PASS] 6A INJECTION: synthetic curves obeying the kernel exactly, on the real g_bar profiles, must be read back at the injected a_0 -- the control that item 25's slope-fixed estimator failed at +0.095 dex   (bias +0.003 dex at canonical, -0.002 at alt)
  [PASS] 6B MUTATION: a 4x wrong a_0 must come back 4x wrong   (bias +0.001 dex from the injected 4x canonical)
  [PASS] 6C MUTATION: shuffling which radius gets which V_obs INSIDE each galaxy leaves every normalisation intact and destroys only the shape -- the fit must get much worse   (shuffled chi^2 897956 at its own best a_0 2.000e-09, against 12583 unshuffled)

==============================================================================================================================
VERDICT ON K1 AND K8
==============================================================================================================================
  K1  a_0(shape, Upsilon = 0.5) = 1.3462e-10; EXACTLY distance-free (lever +0.0e+00) and free
      of the V_obs sin i (lever +0.0e+00), but d log a_0/d log Upsilon = +1.363
      and d log a_0/d log cos i = +1.427.  It measures a_0/Upsilon^1.36.
  K8  Sigma_M = a_0/(2 pi G) = 107/129 Msun/pc^2 against HI's ~10; measured
      max gas-only y in a gas-dominated SPARC region = 0.138.  The no-go holds on the data.
  NEW two-channel solve: Upsilon = 0.487, a_0 = 1.282e-10 (+0.137 dex canonical, +0.055 dex alt); NOT distance-free.
  LambdaCDM beside: a free NFW halo adds two parameters PER GALAXY to the shape, so it makes no prediction
  in this channel at all; the fair statement is 1 global parameter against 2 x N_gal, and the only
  falsifiable comparison computed here is Newton with no boost, which the channel excludes.

